---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageClass: home
description: Pastor Bola Akinlabi — Global Co-Lead Pastor of The Elevation Church, visionary behind Jewels and convener of Made for More. Teaching, books and speaking invitations.
---
{#- → WordPress: front-page.php, each <section> a template part or block pattern. -#}
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import arrow, picture, mediaCard, bookCover -%}

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero__grid">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <h1 id="hero-title"><span class="line"><span>Rooted in faith.</span></span><span class="line"><span>Made for <em>more.</em></span></span></h1>
      <p class="hero__desc">Helping women and families grow in faith, walk in purpose and build lives of lasting impact.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn" href="/speaking/">Invite Pastor Bola {{ arrow() }}</a>
        <a class="link" href="/about/">Meet Pastor Bola {{ arrow() }}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__role">
        <p>Global Co-Lead Pastor<strong>The Elevation Church</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__visual">
      <div class="seal" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><defs><path id="seal-circle" d="M50,50 m-40,0 a40,40 0 1,1 80,0 a40,40 0 1,1 -80,0"/></defs><text><textPath href="#seal-circle">Made for more · Women who build · </textPath></text></svg>
        <span class="seal__star">✳</span>
      </div>
      {{ picture("bola-portrait-corporate", "Pastor Bola Akinlabi smiling, in a tailored burgundy suit and white tie", "", "eager") }}
      <div class="hero__caption"><span>Bolarinwa Akinlabi</span><span>A heart for people.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


{%- set book = books[0] %}
<section class="section section--deep" aria-labelledby="books-title">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="reveal">{{ bookCover(book) }}</div>
    <div>
      <span class="tag reveal">{% if book.downloadUrl or book.amazonUrl or (book.ebook and book.ebook.public and book.ebook.file and book.ebook.prices) %}Available now{% else %}Coming soon{% endif %}</span>
      <h2 id="books-title" class="mt-3 reveal" data-delay="1">A new chapter. <em>The same heart.</em></h2>
      <p class="muted mt-3 reveal" data-delay="2" style="max-width:32rem">Women Who Build, Pastor Bola’s first book, draws on the lives of women in Scripture to help you embrace your identity, build with strength and fulfil your purpose.{% if book.ebook and book.ebook.public and book.ebook.file and book.ebook.prices %} Get the e-book today.{% elif not (book.downloadUrl or book.amazonUrl) %} Join the waiting list to be the first to know when it is available.{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="btn-row mt-4 reveal" data-delay="3">
        {% if book.downloadUrl or book.amazonUrl or (book.ebook and book.ebook.public and book.ebook.file and book.ebook.prices) %}<a class="btn btn--light" href="/books/#order">Get the book {{ arrow() }}</a>{% else %}<a class="btn btn--light" href="/books/#waitlist">Join the waiting list {{ arrow() }}</a><a class="link" href="/books/">About the book {{ arrow() }}</a>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <div class="wrap split split--wide-right">
    <div class="intro__visual reveal">
      <div class="intro__arch">
        <img src="/assets/images/bola-portrait-cutout.webp" alt="Pastor Bola Akinlabi smiling, in an ivory blouse" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="538" height="675">
      </div>
      <div class="intro__badge"><strong>Co-Lead Pastor</strong><span>Serving alongside Pastor Godman Akinlabi at The Elevation Church</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="intro__copy">
      <h2 id="intro-title" class="reveal" data-delay="1">Faith, structure <em>and stewardship.</em></h2>
      <div class="reveal" data-delay="2">
        <p>Alongside Pastor Godman Akinlabi, she serves as Global Co-Lead Pastor of The Elevation Church, bringing her own gifts to building the church. Years in treasury and financial management gave her a gift for structure, order and stewardship, and she now brings that foundation to how she serves.</p>
        <p>Her strategic approach to leadership has helped shape key areas of church life, from the children’s ministry to the administration, people and financial structures that support the church’s growth.</p>
        <p>Through biblical teaching, Jewels and the Made for More Conference, she creates room for people to grow in their faith, their families and the purpose God has placed on their lives.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row mt-4 reveal" data-delay="3">
        <a class="link" href="/about/">Discover her story {{ arrow() }}</a>
      </div>
      <p class="signature reveal" data-delay="3">Bola Akinlabi<small>With faith &amp; purpose</small></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap facts mt-5" style="margin-top:var(--s-6)">
    <div class="fact reveal"><p class="fact__num">2010</p><p class="fact__label">The Elevation Church began in Lagos, where she serves as Co-Lead Pastor</p></div>
    <div class="fact reveal" data-delay="1"><p class="fact__num">2015</p><p class="fact__label">Convened the first Made for More Conference</p></div>
    <div class="fact reveal" data-delay="2"><p class="fact__num">3 cities</p><p class="fact__label">Made for More editions in Lagos, London &amp; Toronto</p></div>
    <div class="fact reveal" data-delay="3"><p class="fact__num">10 years</p><p class="fact__label">Of Made for More, celebrated in 2025</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--plum" aria-label="In her words">
  <figure class="wrap quote reveal">
    <span class="quote__mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
    <blockquote><p>It’s not just a conference; it’s a journey from loss to restoration, from ordinary to radiant.</p></blockquote>
    <figcaption>Pastor Bola Akinlabi<span>On Made for More 2025, <cite>BusinessDay</cite></span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="section section--parchment" aria-labelledby="ministry-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <h2 id="ministry-title" class="reveal" data-delay="1">Faith that reaches <em>beyond Sunday.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-head__aside reveal" data-delay="2">Building people, strengthening families and making room for women to flourish.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ministry-layout">
      <a class="feature-card reveal" href="/made-for-more/">
        {{ picture("women-worship-joy", "Women worshipping joyfully at The Elevation Church") }}
        <div class="feature-card__top"><span>The women’s conference</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
        <div>
          <h3>Made for <em>More</em></h3>
          <p>A gathering, a community, and a reminder of all you are called to be. Convened by Pastor Bola since 2015.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <div class="rows">
        <a class="row reveal" href="/ministry/#jewels">
          <span class="row__num">01</span>
          <div><h3>Jewels</h3><p>The women’s ministry of The Elevation Church, pioneered by Pastor Bola.</p></div>
          <span class="row__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="row reveal" data-delay="1" href="/ministry/#elevation">
          <span class="row__num">02</span>
          <div><h3>The Elevation Church</h3><p>A global church family across Africa, Europe, America and beyond, co-led with Pastor Godman.</p></div>
          <span class="row__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="row reveal" data-delay="2" href="/ministry/#better-half">
          <span class="row__num">03</span>
          <div><h3>Better Half</h3><p>Honest conversations with Pastor Godman on love, communication and building a home.</p></div>
          <span class="row__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--deep" aria-labelledby="m4m-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <h2 id="m4m-title" class="reveal" data-delay="1">A decade of <em>women who build.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost reveal" data-delay="2" href="/made-for-more/">Explore the conference {{ arrow() }}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline reveal" tabindex="0" aria-label="Made for More editions, scrollable">
      {%- for e in editions %}
      <div class="timeline__item{% if e.current %} timeline__item--now{% endif %}">
        <p class="timeline__year">{{ e.year }}</p>
        <p class="timeline__theme">{{ e.theme }}</p>
        {%- if e.note %}
        <p class="timeline__note">{{ e.note }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        <p class="timeline__speakers">{{ e.speakers }}</p>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="media-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <h2 id="media-title" class="reveal" data-delay="1">Let faith have <em>the final word.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <a class="link reveal" data-delay="2" href="/media/">All messages {{ arrow() }}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="media-grid media-grid--feature">
      {%- for m in messages | where("featured", true) | limit(3) %}
      {{ mediaCard(m) }}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="speak-title">
  <div class="wrap speaking-band">
    <div>
      <h2 id="speak-title" class="reveal" data-delay="1">Bring the conversation <em>to your community.</em></h2>
      <p class="muted mt-3 reveal" data-delay="2">For conferences, churches, leadership gatherings and women’s events. Pastor Bola brings clarity, wisdom and a practical approach that moves people to act.</p>
      <div class="btn-row mt-4 reveal" data-delay="3"><a class="btn" href="/speaking/">Invite Pastor Bola {{ arrow() }}</a><a class="link" href="/press-kit/">Press kit {{ arrow() }}</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="rows">
      {%- for t in topics | limit(4) %}
      <div class="row reveal" data-delay="{{ loop.index0 }}"><span class="row__num">0{{ loop.index }}</span><div><h3>{{ t.title }}</h3><p>{{ t.summary }}</p></div></div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap" style="margin-top:var(--s-6)">
    {% include "partials/why-invite.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight" aria-label="In the press" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="press mt-3 reveal" data-delay="1">
      {%- for p in press %}
      <a href="{{ p.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press__outlet">{{ p.outlet }}</span><span class="press__title">{{ p.title }}</span><span class="press__date">{{ p.date }}</span></a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
